### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 8. CATAT METER — VALIDASI BISNIS (harus 422)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ── Golongan non-aktif (grup.stts=0) ─────────────────────
### Ganti @id_pel ke pelanggan dengan grup tidak aktif
POST {{base_url}}/catat-meter
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{api_key}}

{
  "id_pelanggan": 99999,
  "id_petugas": {{id_petugas}},
  "id_kondisi_meter": "N",
  "stand_meter": 2000,
  "waktu_catat": "2026-07-03T09:30:00+07:00",
  "latitude": -5.12345678,
  "longitude": 119.12345678,
  "foto": "https://storage.tirta-pase.id/cater/foto/meter.jpg"
}

### ── Duplikat periode (id_pel + periode sudah ada) ────────
### Jalankan 2x — pertama 201, kedua 422
POST {{base_url}}/catat-meter
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{api_key}}

{
  "id_pelanggan": {{id_pel}},
  "id_petugas": {{id_petugas}},
  "id_kondisi_meter": "N",
  "stand_meter": 1600,
  "waktu_catat": "2026-07-15T10:00:00+07:00",
  "latitude": -5.12345678,
  "longitude": 119.12345678,
  "foto": "https://storage.tirta-pase.id/cater/foto/2026/07/duplicate_test.jpg"
}

### ── Tagihan sudah dibayar (id_pay != 0) ──────────────────
### Ganti @id_pel ke pelanggan yang sudah lunas periode ini
POST {{base_url}}/catat-meter
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{api_key}}

{
  "id_pelanggan": 99999,
  "id_petugas": {{id_petugas}},
  "id_kondisi_meter": "N",
  "stand_meter": 2000,
  "waktu_catat": "2026-07-03T09:30:00+07:00",
  "latitude": -5.12345678,
  "longitude": 119.12345678,
  "foto": "https://storage.tirta-pase.id/cater/foto/meter.jpg"
}

### ── stand_meter < meter_awal (lebih kecil dr bulan lalu) ─
POST {{base_url}}/catat-meter
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{api_key}}

{
  "id_pelanggan": {{id_pel_banyak}},
  "id_petugas": {{id_petugas}},
  "id_kondisi_meter": "N",
  "stand_meter": 1,
  "waktu_catat": "2026-08-03T10:00:00+07:00",
  "latitude": -5.12345678,
  "longitude": 119.12345678,
  "foto": "https://storage.tirta-pase.id/cater/foto/meter.jpg"
}


