### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 10. CATAT METER — HISTORY
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ── Riwayat default ──────────────────────────────────────
GET {{base_url}}/catat-meter/history?page=1&per_page=20
Authorization: Bearer {{api_key}}

### ── Filter by id_petugas ─────────────────────────────────
GET {{base_url}}/catat-meter/history?id_petugas={{id_petugas}}
Authorization: Bearer {{api_key}}

### ── Filter by date range ─────────────────────────────────
GET {{base_url}}/catat-meter/history?id_petugas={{id_petugas}}&date_from=2026-07-01&date_to=2026-09-30
Authorization: Bearer {{api_key}}

### ── Kombinasi filter: petugas + date ─────────────────────
GET {{base_url}}/catat-meter/history?id_petugas={{id_petugas}}&date_from=2026-07-01&date_to=2026-12-31&per_page=50
Authorization: Bearer {{api_key}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 11. ERROR HANDLING — EDGE CASES
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ── API Key kosong ───────────────────────────────────────
GET {{base_url}}/pelanggan
Authorization: Bearer

### ── Format Authorization salah (tanpa Bearer) ────────────
GET {{base_url}}/pelanggan
Authorization: some-random-key

### ── URL tidak ada → 404 ──────────────────────────────────
GET {{base_url}}/nonexistent-endpoint
Authorization: Bearer {{api_key}}

### ── Method salah (GET ke POST endpoint) → 405 ────────────
GET {{base_url}}/catat-meter
Authorization: Bearer {{api_key}}


